  "observations": [
    "All six default compartments give identical ledgers, so compartments do not interfere.",
    "Every parameter changes the ledgers in its expected direction; none is inert.",
    "Largest margin effects at the range ends: temperature-window shift (-16.7 / +6.7 EUR/m2), fruit growth potential (-8.2 / +6.9), maximum LAI (-7.2 / +4.0), LED efficacy (-3.2 / +1.5).",
    "The temperature-window effect is asymmetric under this fixed policy: a 1.5 C lower window costs 23% of harvest, a higher one adds 9%.",
    "Leakage and ventilation mainly move heat and CO2 use (up to +7.4% heat) with small margin effects under current prices.",
    "Earliness (tEndSum +/-10%) has the smallest effect (about 0.5 EUR/m2).",
    "Ranges are not changed on the basis of these results."
  ]
